%h4{style: "display: block;font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 14px;font-style: italic;font-weight: normal;line-height: 100%;letter-spacing: normal;margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 10px;margin-left: 0;text-align: left;color: #808080;"} Nitrous provides a lightning fast way to setup and manage development environments in the cloud.
%p{style: "-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;"} Nitrous provides you with a free development environment which you can start coding on immediately. Your code is available from any location, and many tools and interpreters are already setup for you (Ruby on Rails, Python/Django, Go, Node.JS, etc).
%p{style: "-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;"}
  Sign up with the referral link below in order for you and #{@user.username} to receive an extra 250MB of storage with your account:
%p{style: "-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;-ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;"}
  %a{href: "#{_reg_url}"} Create a Free Account with Nitrous
  / // END BODY
